&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://go.dev/ref/spec#Logical_operators"&gt;https://go.dev/ref/spec#Logical_operators&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="address-operators"&gt;Address operators&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#address-operators" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
